  "Scope": "One bounded terminal Set repeat Count pilot, baseline16502c14 plus archived patch. Extend existing complete-root greedy/min\u003E=1/no-capture fiveinstruction proof from category/shorthand/hybrid to Set; reuse positive ASCII mask predicate, original per-scalar work, strict validation and final publication authority. Wider/complemented/folded membership stays scalar. No new engine/fields/API/modes or unchecked access. Eleven equal-result public Count cases: actual English ordinary/compiled/finite-live/deadline-live, unchanged Russian category, dense maxima/tails, mixed scalar gaps, BMP complemented/folded-Kelvin sets; unchanged capture/ASCII literal controls. Four before/after/predecoded/decode-then Regex lanes. Full strict validation included, compilation/setup excluded, result batches consumed after timing with host arrays outside allocation counters. Warm1.5s/min64calls, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples each\u003E=20ms. One120s cap, at most one selected noise confirmation. No package/fullcatalog campaign. All BCL comparator cases overlap scalar semantics; no negated supplementary case is timed against UTF16 Regex.",
